WEBVTT

00:24.120 --> 00:25.400
Greetings, Commander.

00:25.400 --> 00:27.530
You've been working hard, Commander.

00:31.350 --> 00:32.560
Rest assured, Commander.

00:32.560 --> 00:34.110
Everything is normal in Qianshan.

00:34.110 --> 00:36.070
Under your wise and capable governance,

00:36.070 --> 00:38.310
not a single opium pipe
can be found in Qianshan now.

00:38.310 --> 00:39.280
We will show no mercy

00:39.280 --> 00:40.500
to anyone caught hiding one.

00:40.500 --> 00:42.540
The people all sing your praises.

00:42.660 --> 00:45.430
You're getting better and better
at talking.

00:46.130 --> 00:48.190
I'm only back here catching my breath

00:48.310 --> 00:50.960
because over 1,000 of my men
gave their lives for it.

00:50.960 --> 00:53.240
The ceasefire is only temporary.

00:53.430 --> 00:56.880
Your Guard Corps will inevitably
be sent to the front lines as well.

00:56.880 --> 00:58.740
You'd better prepare in advance.

01:00.360 --> 01:01.290
Yes, Commander.

01:02.710 --> 01:03.750
Reporting, Commander.

01:03.750 --> 01:04.550
She's here.

01:18.110 --> 01:19.370
Do you find her pretty?

01:20.110 --> 01:21.030
I wouldn't dare, Commander.

01:21.030 --> 01:21.800
You may leave.

01:21.800 --> 01:23.390
Then I'll take my leave.

01:27.440 --> 01:28.640
It's been a long time,

01:28.830 --> 01:29.800
Miss Jiang.

03:10.280 --> 03:14.200
[A Prophet]

03:14.960 --> 03:16.930
[Episode 5]

03:17.800 --> 03:18.800
Corpse Driving?

03:19.710 --> 03:21.590
It's a form of sorcery
practiced in Xiangxi.

03:21.590 --> 03:22.960
Back when there were wars,

03:22.960 --> 03:24.960
many people from Xiangxi
died far from home.

03:24.960 --> 03:26.360
Some local sorcerers

03:26.430 --> 03:27.710
would then use soul-summoning rituals

03:27.710 --> 03:29.240
to gather
their three souls and seven spirits

03:29.240 --> 03:30.480
back into the corpses.

03:30.480 --> 03:32.240
That way, they could bring the bodies home

03:32.240 --> 03:34.520
so the dead wouldn't
become wandering ghosts.

03:34.520 --> 03:36.320
We actually do this kind of work?

03:36.710 --> 03:37.550
Well, there you go.

03:37.550 --> 03:38.320
I'm telling you,

03:38.320 --> 03:39.390
our Longxuya Corpse Driving

03:39.390 --> 03:41.050
is really famous around here.

03:41.829 --> 03:43.030
They call it sorcery,

03:43.240 --> 03:45.110
but in reality,
it's all done by living people.

03:45.110 --> 03:46.640
Exactly. It's all done by living people.

03:46.640 --> 03:48.430
They wash the corpses clean.

03:48.520 --> 03:49.550
Then they take a knife

03:49.550 --> 03:50.200
to cut them open,

03:50.200 --> 03:51.240
remove all the internal organs,

03:51.240 --> 03:52.240
and fill the body cavities
with a preservative solution

03:52.240 --> 03:52.920
to keep them from rotting.

03:52.920 --> 03:53.760
Once the bodies have dried,

03:53.760 --> 03:54.590
they tie them to poles

03:54.590 --> 03:55.200
and string them together.

03:55.200 --> 03:56.110
Then two strong men

03:56.110 --> 03:57.550
can carry them all the way home.

03:57.550 --> 03:58.760
After all that,

03:59.040 --> 04:02.240
would anyone still believe in the whole
three souls and seven spirits story?

04:02.240 --> 04:04.080
That's where our cleverness comes in.

04:04.080 --> 04:04.640
Let me tell you,

04:04.640 --> 04:05.830
these corpse drivers

04:05.830 --> 04:07.760
dress the corpses in burial robes.

04:07.830 --> 04:08.990
Then those two strong men

04:08.990 --> 04:10.250
dress up as corpses too

04:10.480 --> 04:12.410
and make the corpses "jump" along.

04:13.550 --> 04:14.550
If anyone happens

04:14.640 --> 04:16.269
to stop and watch along the way,

04:16.269 --> 04:18.029
they pull little tricks
like making the corpses rise

04:18.029 --> 04:20.180
or pretending there are ghosts,
just to scare them away.

04:20.180 --> 04:23.110
They'd go home and spread the story
from door to door.

04:24.030 --> 04:27.680
No wonder Xiangxi Corpse Driving
has been passed down for a thousand years.

04:27.680 --> 04:29.470
Anyway, back to the matter at hand.

04:29.470 --> 04:31.230
Mr. Zheng's coal mine in Anping

04:31.230 --> 04:32.909
had a mining accident recently,

04:32.909 --> 04:34.909
and his son was buried underground.

04:35.080 --> 04:36.470
He hired us

04:36.510 --> 04:38.370
to bring the body back for burial.

04:38.409 --> 04:40.740
Heng is already waiting
for you in Anping.

04:41.150 --> 04:42.100
Who is Heng?

04:43.200 --> 04:44.330
The Chief's nephew.

04:44.390 --> 04:46.030
Zheng Tianming is hosting a banquet

04:46.030 --> 04:47.890
at Sanyuan Restaurant tomorrow.

04:48.190 --> 04:49.110
Ruhui,

04:49.630 --> 04:50.950
Starting tomorrow,

04:51.710 --> 04:53.760
you'll be the 18th-generation successor

04:53.760 --> 04:55.350
to Xiangxi Corpse Driving.

04:55.790 --> 04:56.520
Me?

05:02.710 --> 05:05.080
Sir, spare me a bite to eat.

05:05.350 --> 05:06.880
Please, I'm begging you.

05:14.030 --> 05:15.270
Thank you, sir.

05:20.080 --> 05:23.880
[No. 26, Jiudao Kan. Come see me at once.]

05:31.830 --> 05:33.520
Have you looked into Zheng Tianming?

05:33.520 --> 05:34.640
He does exist.

05:35.440 --> 05:37.710
And there really is a mine in Anping.

05:38.720 --> 05:42.540
Why would Blind Du specifically
send you for this Corpse Driving task?

05:42.540 --> 05:44.770
Blind Du probably
has other dealings with Zheng Tianming,

05:44.770 --> 05:46.830
so he considers him quite important.

05:46.890 --> 05:49.010
It makes sense for me to go

05:49.030 --> 05:50.830
as a successor of Xiangxi Corpse Driving.

05:50.830 --> 05:51.590
Besides,

05:51.830 --> 05:53.159
if anything goes wrong,

05:53.440 --> 05:55.030
they can pin the blame on me

05:55.230 --> 05:57.159
instead of implicating Longxuya.

05:58.909 --> 06:01.080
Corpse Driving
isn't some elaborate scheme.

06:01.080 --> 06:02.640
It's just transporting bodies back

06:02.640 --> 06:04.270
and making a few bucks for the work.

06:04.270 --> 06:05.440
What could go wrong?

06:07.830 --> 06:09.320
If this really is just Corpse Driving,

06:09.320 --> 06:11.380
Longxuya has plenty of low-level men

06:11.910 --> 06:13.370
Mr. Zheng has seen before.

06:20.640 --> 06:23.640
You got through the Pangzhou affair
far too smoothly.

06:23.760 --> 06:24.590
I know

06:25.150 --> 06:27.080
you look down on the Tianxiang Sect

06:27.270 --> 06:28.710
and on Blind Du.

06:29.270 --> 06:30.470
But I'm warning you,

06:31.520 --> 06:33.760
they're all wolves in human form.

06:34.230 --> 06:35.830
If you underestimate them,

06:36.200 --> 06:39.320
they'll swallow you whole,
flesh and skin,

06:40.150 --> 06:42.480
without leaving so much
as a scrap of bone.

06:42.620 --> 06:44.590
Whatever comes, we'll handle it.

06:45.680 --> 06:47.710
If there really
is something fishy going on,

06:47.710 --> 06:48.570
I'm not afraid.

06:53.710 --> 06:54.390
All right.

06:56.230 --> 06:57.790
Since you've already agreed,

06:57.790 --> 06:58.680
then go ahead.

06:59.710 --> 07:01.370
Just be careful along the way.

07:02.660 --> 07:03.100
Yes.

07:06.680 --> 07:08.610
Have you been to Blind Du's hideout

07:08.760 --> 07:09.470
before?

07:11.390 --> 07:14.320
But it's heavily guarded
and not easy to infiltrate.

07:14.350 --> 07:15.150
That's one of the reasons

07:15.150 --> 07:17.320
I agreed to this Corpse Driving task.

07:18.230 --> 07:19.000
Besides,

07:22.310 --> 07:24.370
I've noticed something suspicious.

08:02.120 --> 08:04.560
So you're the expert from Xiangxi.

08:04.770 --> 08:06.030
What should I call you?

08:06.030 --> 08:07.030
My surname is Lyu.

08:08.710 --> 08:09.590
Mr. Lyu,

08:10.030 --> 08:11.160
please, have a seat.

08:12.880 --> 08:14.010
I deal with the dead,

08:14.150 --> 08:15.710
so I carry a strong corpse aura.

08:15.710 --> 08:17.570
I shouldn't be around the living.

08:18.640 --> 08:19.350
Mr. Lyu,

08:19.420 --> 08:20.540
I've asked you here

08:20.590 --> 08:21.790
to help

08:21.790 --> 08:24.390
bring my son's body back from Anping.

08:25.030 --> 08:27.790
I have only one son, my sole heir.

08:27.890 --> 08:29.890
Now that we're separated
by life and death,

08:29.890 --> 08:31.280
this is all

08:32.630 --> 08:33.990
I can do for him.

08:34.990 --> 08:35.850
Bring the lamp.

08:40.280 --> 08:40.870
What...

08:41.830 --> 08:42.960
What does this mean?

08:43.240 --> 08:44.280
Mr. Zheng,

08:44.680 --> 08:46.300
please clear your mind for now

08:46.300 --> 08:48.780
and recall your son's face and voice.

09:08.070 --> 09:09.630
W-W-What's going on?

09:09.920 --> 09:11.590
The lamp lit itself without any fire.

09:11.590 --> 09:13.100
This lamp is called a Soul-Guiding Lamp.

09:13.100 --> 09:15.810
It is meant
to guide your son's spirit home.

09:16.030 --> 09:17.790
You'll also need to place this lamp

09:17.790 --> 09:19.520
in the family mourning hall.

09:19.740 --> 09:20.860
After seven days,

09:21.230 --> 09:22.760
when we return with the body

09:22.800 --> 09:24.710
and his wandering soul
returns to the body,

09:24.710 --> 09:25.840
the lamp will go out.

09:26.630 --> 09:27.590
In that case,

09:28.110 --> 09:29.240
I'll leave it to you,

09:29.510 --> 09:30.920
Mr. Lyu.

09:37.170 --> 09:41.420
[Anping]

09:37.760 --> 09:38.400
Let's go.

09:56.080 --> 09:56.800
Senior Du.

09:58.280 --> 09:59.010
You're here.

10:00.040 --> 10:00.640
Come on in.

10:00.830 --> 10:01.360
Let's go.

10:03.630 --> 10:03.990
Come on,

10:03.990 --> 10:04.450
inside.

10:09.350 --> 10:10.950
This is Zheng Qigong's body.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.830
The others are the bodies
of his fellow townsmen.

10:12.830 --> 10:14.040
We'll take them all back together.

10:14.040 --> 10:14.750
Senior Du,

10:15.280 --> 10:16.870
how many strings of coins
did you hang up,

10:16.870 --> 10:19.000
and how many talismans did you put out?

10:19.920 --> 10:21.110
Everything was done
according to the usual practice.

10:21.110 --> 10:21.780
No problem.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.320
I've got everything ready.

10:26.320 --> 10:26.990
No need to check.

10:26.990 --> 10:27.900
You must be tired from the journey.

10:27.900 --> 10:28.630
Have some water.

10:28.630 --> 10:29.040
Come,

10:29.350 --> 10:29.880
sit down.

10:30.870 --> 10:33.200
I've got everything you need
ready for you.

10:33.200 --> 10:35.200
Let's hurry and get you dressed up.

10:35.230 --> 10:36.230
Once it gets dark,

10:36.230 --> 10:38.030
we'll get on the road right away.

10:38.510 --> 10:39.110
All right.

10:39.560 --> 10:40.490
What's this for?

10:41.560 --> 10:43.160
Who's supposed to wear this?

10:50.200 --> 10:52.400
When the dead pass through,

10:52.990 --> 10:55.230
the living must keep their distance.

10:55.730 --> 10:57.730
Copper bells lead the way.

10:58.560 --> 11:00.750
The road to the underworld opens.

11:01.440 --> 11:03.280
We escort the dead home,

11:03.990 --> 11:05.850
so they may return to their roots.

11:06.830 --> 11:09.230
The dead carry yin energy
and evil spirits;

11:09.280 --> 11:11.340
the living must keep their distance.

11:12.440 --> 11:14.590
When the dead pass through,

11:15.350 --> 11:17.470
the living must keep their distance.

11:18.400 --> 11:20.440
Copper bells lead the way.

11:21.110 --> 11:23.350
The road to the underworld opens.

11:24.400 --> 11:25.800
Halt.

11:26.320 --> 11:27.450
It'll be light soon.

11:27.830 --> 11:28.760
We'll camp here.

11:29.830 --> 11:30.470
Senior Du,

11:30.750 --> 11:32.430
how are we supposed to sleep out here?

11:32.430 --> 11:33.830
There's a river up ahead.

11:33.830 --> 11:35.160
We'll camp by the river.

11:35.440 --> 11:36.370
The woods by the river

11:36.370 --> 11:37.770
are lush and full of life.

11:38.110 --> 11:39.510
Resting the corpses against the trees

11:39.510 --> 11:43.040
will keep their three souls
and seven spirits from dispersing.

11:43.360 --> 11:44.070
Senior Du,

11:44.510 --> 11:46.870
I know Corpse Driving is supposed
to be done by night and rest by day.

11:46.870 --> 11:49.160
But shouldn't we rest
when we get to the mortuary?

11:49.160 --> 11:51.390
If these bodies get mauled
by wild animals in the mountains,

11:51.390 --> 11:52.920
we'll have a hard time explaining it
when we get back.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.520
Why do you have so much to say?

11:54.540 --> 11:56.200
We'll rest where I say we rest.

11:56.570 --> 11:57.860
How about we switch? You carry them.

11:57.860 --> 11:58.410
No, no.

12:01.960 --> 12:04.200
Why aren't we resting at the mortuary?

12:04.510 --> 12:07.400
This is such a miserable place
to spend the night.

12:08.560 --> 12:10.350
You'll have to ask Senior Du.

12:10.990 --> 12:13.100
He's the one who said we should camp here.

12:13.100 --> 12:14.430
He's Chief Du's nephew.

12:14.920 --> 12:16.560
We do as he says.

12:17.230 --> 12:19.800
If one of the corpses really does rise,
it'll be on him.

12:19.800 --> 12:20.990
Don't scare me.

12:27.960 --> 12:29.510
One of the corpses has turned!

12:29.510 --> 12:30.200
What?

12:33.870 --> 12:34.800
What's going on?

12:35.590 --> 12:36.720
A corpse has turned!

12:37.660 --> 12:39.510
When a corpse turns on the way home,

12:39.510 --> 12:41.320
it's either because the dead
bore a grievance in life

12:41.320 --> 12:43.320
or met with misfortune after death.

12:44.200 --> 12:44.560
You,

12:44.990 --> 12:45.960
go see what's going on.

12:45.960 --> 12:46.680
Me?

12:46.780 --> 12:47.420
Go!

12:53.130 --> 12:54.080
Be careful.

13:46.220 --> 13:48.080
Oh my, it scared the life out of me.

13:49.400 --> 13:49.920
Oh my!

13:50.750 --> 13:51.230
Oh my!

13:53.040 --> 13:53.970
You damn monkey!

13:54.510 --> 13:57.040
They're already dead, and now they
have to be mauled by monkeys.

13:57.040 --> 13:57.640
Senior Du,

13:57.920 --> 14:00.160
I told you we should've stayed
at the mortuary.

14:00.160 --> 14:01.040
That damn monkey

14:01.040 --> 14:02.440
scared the hell out of me.

14:03.110 --> 14:04.470
Are the bodies all right?

14:04.470 --> 14:05.320
They're fine, they're fine.

14:05.320 --> 14:05.990
I checked them.

14:05.990 --> 14:06.920
They are intact.

14:07.800 --> 14:08.530
Silly Liang,

14:08.560 --> 14:09.320
give me a hand.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.350
It's almost daylight.

14:10.350 --> 14:12.210
Let's cover them with this cloth.

14:12.560 --> 14:13.510
One, two, lift.

14:23.830 --> 14:25.200
Greetings, Chief.

14:25.560 --> 14:27.760
Sorry to keep you waiting,
Adjutant Xu.

14:28.870 --> 14:30.160
Chief Du,

14:30.370 --> 14:33.030
it's only a few steps
to the Longxuya inner hall.

14:33.350 --> 14:35.440
Do you really need
to lean on a human crutch?

14:35.440 --> 14:37.370
I've been waiting here for an hour.

14:37.470 --> 14:39.000
What are you going on about?

14:39.400 --> 14:41.110
I normally wouldn't, of course.

14:41.110 --> 14:43.240
But you came first thing this morning.

14:43.400 --> 14:44.890
You must have something important
to discuss.

14:44.890 --> 14:46.220
I had to hurry, didn't I?

14:47.990 --> 14:49.120
All of you, get lost.

14:50.900 --> 14:51.900
You too, get lost.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.130
Adjutant Xu,

14:59.080 --> 15:00.610
Hey, hey. Let me remind you:

15:00.680 --> 15:01.830
I'm not in uniform today.

15:01.830 --> 15:03.290
Don't call me Adjutant Xu.

15:03.710 --> 15:05.310
Call me Mr. Zheng, all right?

15:05.680 --> 15:06.940
Okay, okay, Mr. Zheng.

15:06.950 --> 15:08.480
What brings you here today?

15:11.590 --> 15:14.520
Don't you think we need
to get moving on our business?

15:14.630 --> 15:16.090
We discussed this before.

15:16.320 --> 15:18.160
If we're going to do this deal,

15:18.560 --> 15:20.800
we have to wait for things to die down.

15:21.320 --> 15:24.200
If your Colonel Lei hadn't
been embezzling military pay

15:24.200 --> 15:26.370
to the point where he can't cover
the shortfall anymore,

15:26.370 --> 15:28.400
we Longxuya wouldn't have had

15:28.400 --> 15:30.160
to risk our lives

15:30.380 --> 15:32.650
to take this deal.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.150
You...

15:40.990 --> 15:42.190
All right, all right.

15:42.830 --> 15:43.350
Mr. Du,

15:43.350 --> 15:44.800
you're right.

15:44.920 --> 15:46.400
From here on out,

15:46.400 --> 15:48.000
I'll do as you say, all right?

15:49.510 --> 15:50.200
But...

15:50.200 --> 15:52.800
But Commander Feng
has given strict orders:

15:53.230 --> 15:55.830
anyone caught selling opium
will be executed.

15:57.230 --> 15:59.160
Then what am I supposed
to tell the Colonel?

15:59.160 --> 16:00.690
Go back and tell Colonel Lei

16:01.440 --> 16:03.470
I have another gift prepared for him.

16:03.470 --> 16:05.600
Not only will it make up for his losses,

16:05.710 --> 16:07.770
it'll even get him promoted one rank.

16:09.080 --> 16:10.110
How so?

16:10.830 --> 16:12.290
I have a trick up my sleeve.

16:13.400 --> 16:13.960
Ruhui,

16:14.110 --> 16:14.970
let me tell you,

16:15.350 --> 16:17.040
spearfishing takes skill.

16:17.230 --> 16:18.230
You can't just stab straight down,

16:18.230 --> 16:18.750
you know?

16:18.750 --> 16:20.410
You have to aim a little lower.

16:29.470 --> 16:30.000
See that?

16:30.130 --> 16:31.170
How's my skill?

16:32.870 --> 16:33.600
Pretty good.

16:34.190 --> 16:35.510
It'd be a shame
not to make a fisherman out of you.

16:35.510 --> 16:36.040
Right?

16:36.830 --> 16:37.590
Liang.

16:38.440 --> 16:40.900
Why did you join Longxuya
in the first place?

16:41.320 --> 16:42.560
Just to make a living.

16:44.630 --> 16:45.360
What's this?

16:48.990 --> 16:49.990
It's opium paste.

16:50.400 --> 16:52.060
What, you're into this stuff?

16:52.400 --> 16:52.920
What,

16:53.650 --> 16:54.250
want some?

16:54.590 --> 16:55.990
I don't touch this stuff.

16:56.280 --> 16:57.960
And I'd advise you not to either.

16:57.960 --> 16:58.400
I'm telling you,

16:58.400 --> 17:00.470
the new Commander Feng in Qianshan
hates this stuff more than anything.

17:00.470 --> 17:03.330
If you get caught with it,
you'll be shot on the spot.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.230
Then tell me,

17:05.599 --> 17:06.640
if our branch

17:06.839 --> 17:08.700
gets caught selling opium paste,

17:08.790 --> 17:10.450
what do you think will happen?

17:10.680 --> 17:11.609
What do you mean?

17:13.710 --> 17:15.010
This block of opium paste

17:15.010 --> 17:16.540
came out of a corpse.

17:17.310 --> 17:17.920
A corpse?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.310
You mean...

17:24.690 --> 17:26.410
you mean Senior Du?

17:26.960 --> 17:28.310
Now, is it

17:28.310 --> 17:29.310
worth losing your life

17:29.310 --> 17:29.960
just to make a living?

17:29.960 --> 17:30.920
Of course not.

17:31.810 --> 17:33.310
Maybe we should report it
to the authorities.

17:33.310 --> 17:34.110
You fool.

17:34.130 --> 17:35.360
The opium paste is inside the corpse,

17:35.360 --> 17:36.600
and we're both corpse drivers.

17:36.600 --> 17:37.510
If we report it,

17:37.680 --> 17:39.840
how could either of us prove
we have nothing to do with it?

17:39.840 --> 17:40.840
Then what do we do?

17:42.310 --> 17:43.170
We're done for.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.360
Liang,

17:46.360 --> 17:47.360
you said earlier

17:47.510 --> 17:48.550
that our branch has handled plenty

17:48.550 --> 17:50.080
of corpse-transport jobs.

17:50.270 --> 17:52.030
You really don't know

17:52.840 --> 17:54.570
what we've been transporting?

17:54.790 --> 17:55.990
Heaven and earth, gods and spirits above,

17:55.990 --> 17:56.920
I, Silly Liang,
swear I have absolutely no idea.

17:56.920 --> 17:57.750
Even if I did know,

17:57.750 --> 17:59.840
I wouldn't dare get involved with them.

17:59.840 --> 18:00.680
We're done for, we're done for.

18:00.680 --> 18:01.510
If this gets discovered,

18:01.510 --> 18:02.970
we'll definitely be shot.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.070
I haven't even

18:04.070 --> 18:05.200
gotten married yet.

18:07.200 --> 18:08.470
How about we set fire to it,

18:08.470 --> 18:09.000
then run?

18:09.230 --> 18:09.880
No.

18:10.750 --> 18:12.330
We need to get back as soon as possible,

18:12.330 --> 18:14.640
and we need to take
this batch of opium paste with us.

18:14.640 --> 18:15.320
Why?

18:16.940 --> 18:18.880
There's nothing you or I
can do on the way.

18:18.880 --> 18:20.120
We can only find a way

18:20.440 --> 18:21.500
out of this dead end

18:21.500 --> 18:23.100
once we get back to Qianshan.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.660
You just said Commander Feng in Qianshan

18:30.660 --> 18:31.880
hates this stuff the most?

18:31.880 --> 18:32.410
Exactly.

18:35.840 --> 18:36.510
Senior Du,

18:37.510 --> 18:39.550
where are we putting the bodies
once we get back to Qianshan?

18:39.550 --> 18:40.950
Yongzhen Taoist Temple.

18:41.120 --> 18:42.920
Once we deliver the bodies there

18:43.120 --> 18:44.400
and get them ready,

18:44.710 --> 18:46.550
the families will come
on the fifth day of the lunar month.

18:46.550 --> 18:48.200
Once the funeral rites are done
and the bodies are buried,

18:48.200 --> 18:49.200
our job

18:49.840 --> 18:50.840
will be finished.

18:52.600 --> 18:53.530
Three days left.

18:54.200 --> 18:55.600
We've got plenty of time.

18:58.470 --> 18:59.070
Senior Du,

18:59.440 --> 19:00.100
here you go.

19:00.310 --> 19:00.910
Is it done?

19:05.440 --> 19:06.160
Senior Du,

19:06.640 --> 19:07.440
if you ask me,

19:07.960 --> 19:10.070
we should take the main road from here.

19:10.070 --> 19:12.000
The sooner we get back, the better.

19:12.200 --> 19:13.600
There's war in the north.

19:13.920 --> 19:14.840
There are checkpoints

19:14.840 --> 19:16.440
everywhere on the main road,

19:16.710 --> 19:19.360
and the questioning alone
will take us a lot more time.

19:19.360 --> 19:20.160
The back roads

19:20.440 --> 19:21.900
would be more manageable.

19:22.200 --> 19:24.710
Who's going to check us?
We're corpse drivers.

19:24.710 --> 19:25.550
Besides, I think

19:25.550 --> 19:26.790
it might rain.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.880
The back roads will be muddy then.

19:28.880 --> 19:30.840
If anything goes wrong,
we'll be in trouble.

19:30.840 --> 19:31.640
Besides,

19:32.030 --> 19:32.430
it's no good making the long,

19:32.430 --> 19:34.400
arduous journey back.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.200
Let's get into the city sooner.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.260
We can have some fun

19:37.360 --> 19:38.790
while we have the chance.

19:43.230 --> 19:43.830
All right.

19:44.840 --> 19:46.030
We'll take the main road

19:46.030 --> 19:47.230
as you suggest, then.

19:51.140 --> 19:52.380
I only speared two.

19:52.800 --> 19:54.330
How about I take a hit first?

20:07.190 --> 20:08.080
You go first.

20:08.470 --> 20:09.800
I'll go spear some more.

20:12.910 --> 20:13.670
Your papers.

20:14.650 --> 20:15.850
Here you go, officer.

20:20.960 --> 20:21.640
Who are you?

20:22.210 --> 20:24.470
What are you doing here, playing tricks?

20:24.550 --> 20:25.160
Officer,

20:25.640 --> 20:26.900
we're corpse drivers,

20:27.410 --> 20:28.640
taking the dead home.

20:29.310 --> 20:30.240
Corpse drivers?

20:31.340 --> 20:32.580
Are you planning

20:32.990 --> 20:34.640
to put on a play dressed like that?

20:34.640 --> 20:35.960
The corpse can move on its own?

20:35.960 --> 20:37.030
How do you do that?

20:37.440 --> 20:38.840
It's sorcery,
passed down through generations.

20:38.840 --> 20:40.770
It's hard to explain in a few words.

20:43.470 --> 20:45.640
Let me see what kind of sorcery it is.

20:46.490 --> 20:47.060
Officer,

20:47.760 --> 20:48.710
this is a shroud.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.400
It doesn't have any pockets
to hide anything in.

20:50.400 --> 20:51.360
We won't know

20:51.440 --> 20:52.500
until we search it.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.550
You can't undo the shroud.

20:55.550 --> 20:57.160
Otherwise, the three souls
and seven spirits won't stay together.

20:57.160 --> 20:58.160
Get out of the way!

20:58.550 --> 20:59.710
How am I supposed to know

20:59.710 --> 21:01.510
what's inside if I don't undo it?

21:02.200 --> 21:03.360
I'll undo them all.

21:07.260 --> 21:08.340
Screw you!

21:18.030 --> 21:19.230
How dare you raise a hand to me!

21:19.230 --> 21:20.270
You've got a death wish.

21:20.270 --> 21:21.120
Beat him up!

21:27.030 --> 21:28.880
Stop! Stop! Please! Stop!

21:29.880 --> 21:30.510
Officer.

21:31.470 --> 21:32.840
How did these two come back to life?

21:32.840 --> 21:33.970
Human! We're human!

21:34.200 --> 21:35.440
Human!

21:36.310 --> 21:37.200
Living humans!

21:37.200 --> 21:37.880
It's a misunderstanding.

21:37.880 --> 21:38.510
Please,

21:38.640 --> 21:39.900
have mercy, officers.

21:39.920 --> 21:40.710
Officer,

21:40.840 --> 21:41.840
please calm down.

21:42.070 --> 21:42.880
My friend here

21:43.270 --> 21:44.210
has lived deep
in the mountains all his life

21:44.210 --> 21:45.310
and doesn't know any better.

21:45.310 --> 21:46.090
He broke the rules.

21:46.090 --> 21:47.350
Please, go easy on him.

21:48.750 --> 21:49.780
Enough with the excuses!

21:49.780 --> 21:50.310
Officer.

21:50.440 --> 21:51.970
I'll put you somewhere else

21:51.990 --> 21:53.960
so you can cool off.

21:54.470 --> 21:55.270
Take him away!

21:55.310 --> 21:55.840
Officer!

21:55.990 --> 21:56.600
Get lost!

21:56.650 --> 21:57.180
No, wait.

21:57.820 --> 21:59.630
Officer, please don't take him away!

21:59.630 --> 22:00.600
Please don't!

22:02.310 --> 22:02.840
Officer!

22:03.270 --> 22:03.870
How dare he

22:03.920 --> 22:05.350
lay a hand on the officers?

22:05.350 --> 22:06.480
He acted too rashly.

22:06.830 --> 22:08.090
What are we going to do?

22:08.360 --> 22:08.990
How

22:09.350 --> 22:10.260
should I know?

22:11.000 --> 22:13.000
We'll figure it out when we get back.

22:26.750 --> 22:27.960
It's really heavy.

22:35.790 --> 22:37.030
Let me do it.

22:39.440 --> 22:40.040
Senior Du,

22:40.640 --> 22:42.500
we can't just leave Ruhui behind.

22:43.470 --> 22:44.310
How are we supposed to help?

22:44.310 --> 22:46.270
He brought it on himself by showing off.

22:46.270 --> 22:47.130
He deserves it!

22:47.440 --> 22:48.790
Calm down, calm down.

22:49.120 --> 22:50.780
Senior Du, you're so capable.

22:50.790 --> 22:52.390
Please, think of something.

22:55.540 --> 22:56.820
What rotten luck.

23:02.550 --> 23:03.950
Stay here and keep watch.

23:04.470 --> 23:05.440
It's our last night.

23:05.440 --> 23:07.040
Don't let anything go wrong.

23:07.200 --> 23:07.880
Okay.

23:13.120 --> 23:14.470
There has to be a way.

23:14.550 --> 23:17.120
It'll work.

23:23.070 --> 23:23.800
Adjutant Xu.

23:27.600 --> 23:28.580
What are you doing here?

23:28.580 --> 23:29.580
You scared me.

23:30.120 --> 23:30.920
Where are the goods?

23:30.920 --> 23:32.600
The goods are already at
Yongzhen Taoist Temple outside the city.

23:32.600 --> 23:33.400
They'll reach

23:33.600 --> 23:34.550
Longxuya first thing tomorrow morning.

23:34.550 --> 23:37.710
Then why aren't you keeping an eye
on the goods? What are you doing here?

23:37.710 --> 23:38.440
Adjutant Xu,

23:39.510 --> 23:41.400
one of my men got into a scuffle

23:41.630 --> 23:43.440
with the military police
while passing through the city gate.

23:43.440 --> 23:44.640
He's been detained.

23:44.800 --> 23:45.690
Do you think you could—

23:45.690 --> 23:47.160
Nothing was exposed, right?

23:47.160 --> 23:47.920
Don't worry.

23:48.500 --> 23:49.430
Absolutely not.

23:51.020 --> 23:52.480
It's just one low-level man, isn't it?

23:52.480 --> 23:53.440
So what if they arrested him?

23:53.440 --> 23:54.310
At most, he'll get a beating

23:54.310 --> 23:55.880
and be released in a few days.

23:55.880 --> 23:57.070
That's true, but,

23:57.470 --> 23:58.200
Adjutant Xu,

23:58.350 --> 23:59.480
this man is involved

23:59.570 --> 24:01.290
in the gift for Colonel Lei.

24:02.030 --> 24:02.990
What do you mean?

24:03.470 --> 24:04.000
I mean...

24:07.230 --> 24:10.160
You really are good at messing things up.

24:11.710 --> 24:12.400
Wait here.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.330
I'll make a call.

24:13.880 --> 24:15.210
Thank you, Adjutant Xu.

24:18.400 --> 24:19.840
May Ruhui be safe

24:19.980 --> 24:21.440
and return here unharmed.

24:28.230 --> 24:29.760
How did you end up so beat up?

24:30.130 --> 24:31.130
Come on, let's go.

24:34.630 --> 24:35.630
Are you all right?

24:35.920 --> 24:37.120
Those bastards...

24:37.190 --> 24:38.360
If they hadn't had guns,

24:38.360 --> 24:38.680
I would've—

24:38.680 --> 24:39.310
I'd have taken

24:39.310 --> 24:40.570
every one of them down.

24:41.600 --> 24:42.710
Forget about that.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.990
You're back safe,
and that's what matters.

24:44.990 --> 24:45.710
Ruhui,

24:45.990 --> 24:46.710
no offense,

24:47.200 --> 24:48.860
but you've got quite a temper.

24:49.980 --> 24:51.380
You're right, Senior Du.

24:51.850 --> 24:53.180
I won't dare do it again.

24:53.920 --> 24:54.470
I know

24:54.990 --> 24:56.560
you did it for our Longxuya Branch.

24:56.560 --> 24:58.110
If anything had happened to the bodies,

24:58.110 --> 25:00.840
we'd have had a hard time
explaining it tomorrow.

25:01.070 --> 25:02.680
Thank you for understanding, Senior Du.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.540
How about this?

25:03.840 --> 25:04.970
I'll get us some food

25:05.310 --> 25:07.100
and give you a proper welcome back.

25:07.100 --> 25:07.700
Senior Du,

25:07.980 --> 25:09.240
you really shouldn't.

25:09.750 --> 25:11.340
I just caused you so much trouble,

25:11.340 --> 25:12.340
and yet you still—

25:12.880 --> 25:13.550
Ruhui,

25:14.230 --> 25:14.990
say no more.

25:15.200 --> 25:16.510
I've seen how you've performed

25:16.510 --> 25:17.550
throughout this trip.

25:17.550 --> 25:18.200
Besides,

25:18.540 --> 25:19.270
you could say

25:19.320 --> 25:20.920
we've finished this job smoothly enough.

25:20.920 --> 25:21.550
Tonight,

25:21.790 --> 25:22.470
let's have

25:22.790 --> 25:24.030
a good drink together.

25:24.030 --> 25:24.710
Get some rest first

25:24.710 --> 25:26.110
and change your clothes.

25:27.990 --> 25:29.520
Come on, sit down, sit down.

25:32.920 --> 25:34.250
You're this badly hurt.

25:34.440 --> 25:35.970
No drinking tonight, okay?

25:37.880 --> 25:39.080
Thank you, Senior Du.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.120
Cheers.

25:43.750 --> 25:44.350
Senior Du,

25:44.600 --> 25:45.780
thank you for being so forgiving
despite my mistake.

25:45.780 --> 25:47.200
I'd like to raise a toast to you.

25:47.200 --> 25:47.960
No need to be so formal, Ruhui.

25:47.960 --> 25:48.990
Thank you, Senior Du.

25:48.990 --> 25:49.840
You've worked hard on this journey.

25:49.840 --> 25:50.470
Thank you.

25:50.660 --> 25:51.590
You're welcome.

25:55.470 --> 25:56.120
Let's raise

25:56.120 --> 25:57.230
another toast to Senior Du.

25:57.230 --> 25:57.600
Here.

25:57.600 --> 25:58.470
It's my duty.

25:58.990 --> 26:00.030
Bottoms up.

26:09.510 --> 26:10.680
Senior Du,

26:12.380 --> 26:13.210
this cup...

26:40.680 --> 26:41.550
Ruhui!

26:42.350 --> 26:43.030
Ruhui,

26:43.680 --> 26:44.440
get up.

26:44.440 --> 26:45.030
Wake up.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.370
Morning, Liang.

26:47.390 --> 26:48.840
Forget the pleasantries.
Something's happened.

26:48.840 --> 26:49.950
Senior Du is missing.

26:49.950 --> 26:52.160
I've looked everywhere,
but I can't find him.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.270
Maybe he got up early

26:53.270 --> 26:55.070
and went out for a walk.

26:55.070 --> 26:56.070
Why are you getting so worked up?

26:56.070 --> 26:57.100
It's not
that I'm getting worked up for nothing.

26:57.100 --> 26:59.430
All the valuables he brought are gone too.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.810
Could those corpses

27:02.920 --> 27:04.230
have risen

27:04.380 --> 27:05.840
and killed him last night?

27:07.010 --> 27:08.820
Why would they hurt us

27:09.230 --> 27:10.470
after we carried them all the way back?

27:10.470 --> 27:11.510
Then go ask them.

27:14.400 --> 27:14.990
Liang,

27:18.110 --> 27:20.170
have you ever been bullied by ghosts?

27:20.350 --> 27:20.870
No.

27:21.050 --> 27:23.180
I've only ever been bullied by people.

27:27.540 --> 27:28.670
Where are you going?

27:37.180 --> 27:39.780
This doesn't look like
a corpse rising either.

27:47.350 --> 27:48.280
A gunshot wound.

27:49.330 --> 27:50.730
Open it up and take a look.

27:53.070 --> 27:54.200
Where's the stuff?

27:54.710 --> 27:55.230
Liang,

27:55.610 --> 27:57.940
go check the other four corpses. Quickly.

28:21.430 --> 28:23.190
All the opium paste is gone—

28:23.280 --> 28:25.740
how come two blocks
were left in this corpse?

28:40.400 --> 28:40.960
Liang,

28:42.070 --> 28:43.870
remember what I told you before?

28:44.510 --> 28:45.790
Ghosts never hurt you.

28:46.840 --> 28:47.670
It's people

28:48.680 --> 28:49.440
who do.

29:00.050 --> 29:01.130
Easy, Sir.

29:01.350 --> 29:02.350
This way, please.

29:18.310 --> 29:18.920
Mr. Zheng?

29:22.120 --> 29:23.750
Have you fried your brain
on that damn opium?

29:23.750 --> 29:24.680
Take a good look.

29:25.030 --> 29:26.120
My surname is Xu.

29:26.670 --> 29:27.230
Search them.

29:27.230 --> 29:28.430
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

29:36.440 --> 29:36.990
Let's go.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.070
Found it.

29:44.840 --> 29:45.400
Colonel,

29:45.640 --> 29:46.440
we found this.

29:54.150 --> 29:54.870
You two,

29:56.120 --> 29:57.320
anything else to say?

29:58.790 --> 29:59.440
Officer,

29:59.710 --> 30:01.160
we didn't put this there.

30:01.790 --> 30:02.550
Then who did?

30:04.030 --> 30:04.640
He did.

30:05.920 --> 30:07.440
Didn't you get beaten enough?

30:07.440 --> 30:08.770
Stop talking nonsense.

30:09.310 --> 30:10.720
You're caught red-handed,

30:10.720 --> 30:12.220
and you still dare accuse an officer.

30:12.220 --> 30:14.180
Looks like you won't tell the truth

30:14.430 --> 30:15.830
until I teach you a lesson.

30:15.830 --> 30:16.310
Sir.

30:16.550 --> 30:17.210
Attention!

30:26.820 --> 30:28.150
Greetings, Commander.

30:33.070 --> 30:34.930
What brings you here, Commander?

30:47.290 --> 30:48.770
No need to trouble yourself, Commander.

30:48.770 --> 30:50.430
I've already taken care of it.

30:50.460 --> 30:51.590
Caught red-handed.

30:51.950 --> 30:54.680
Didn't you say opium
had been completely banned?

30:54.940 --> 30:55.550
Well,

30:56.680 --> 30:57.600
these two

30:57.960 --> 30:59.270
are outrageously bold—

30:59.270 --> 31:00.550
carrying on their crimes

31:00.550 --> 31:02.420
right under our noses
despite the crackdown.

31:02.420 --> 31:04.150
Don't worry, Commander. I'll—

31:14.140 --> 31:16.140
I'll interrogate these two myself.

31:16.550 --> 31:17.200
Um...

31:18.250 --> 31:18.910
Commander,

31:19.070 --> 31:19.840
these two

31:19.840 --> 31:20.970
never tell the truth

31:21.070 --> 31:22.100
No need to trouble yourself.

31:22.100 --> 31:23.030
Leave them to us.

31:28.580 --> 31:29.730
You have no say in this.

31:29.730 --> 31:30.190
Get out!

31:30.750 --> 31:31.280
Yes, sir.

31:32.310 --> 31:33.070
Take them all away.

31:33.070 --> 31:33.600
Yes, sir.

31:33.680 --> 31:34.540
Take them away.

32:16.030 --> 32:16.560
How is it?

32:23.840 --> 32:24.570
Colonel Lei,

32:25.590 --> 32:26.970
the goods have arrived safely.

32:26.970 --> 32:28.770
Why do you still look so worried?

32:30.840 --> 32:33.070
Longxuya risked everything

32:33.140 --> 32:34.210
to cover my losses.

32:34.650 --> 32:35.730
I, Lei, would like

32:36.080 --> 32:37.880
to thank you first and foremost.

32:38.200 --> 32:39.120
It's just...

32:39.550 --> 32:41.920
It's just that those two fall guys

32:41.920 --> 32:44.360
have ended up in Commander Feng's hands.

32:45.050 --> 32:47.650
You can't help but worry,
can you, Colonel Lei?

32:51.510 --> 32:52.680
Looks like

32:53.160 --> 32:54.470
you already have a solution.

32:54.470 --> 32:55.120
If you ask me,

32:55.120 --> 32:56.030
Colonel Lei,

32:56.030 --> 32:58.440
you can put your mind at ease.

32:58.680 --> 32:59.750
There's no need to worry.

32:59.750 --> 33:01.550
Commander Feng has no evidence.

33:01.550 --> 33:03.840
Why would he believe the nonsense

33:03.990 --> 33:05.520
those two swindlers spout?

33:05.640 --> 33:06.470
If anything

33:06.470 --> 33:08.990
does turn up later

33:08.990 --> 33:10.520
and it comes back to you two,

33:10.960 --> 33:13.290
just insist that it's a false accusation,

33:13.370 --> 33:15.570
and you'll have nothing to worry about.

33:16.460 --> 33:16.990
Chief Du,

33:18.070 --> 33:19.130
I'll still need you

33:19.480 --> 33:20.850
to help me find buyers
for this shipment.

33:20.850 --> 33:23.250
I'll let you know as soon
as I have an update.

33:24.600 --> 33:25.200
All right.

33:25.440 --> 33:27.040
We won't keep you any longer.

33:28.790 --> 33:29.310
Please.

33:34.270 --> 33:35.160
Take care, gentlemen.

33:35.160 --> 33:35.760
All right.

33:46.120 --> 33:46.640
Uncle,

33:47.510 --> 33:49.040
the buyer for this shipment

33:49.160 --> 33:50.290
is already lined up.

33:50.680 --> 33:52.230
When should we make the delivery?

33:52.230 --> 33:52.750
No rush.

33:53.540 --> 33:54.800
Wait for further word.

33:55.120 --> 33:57.160
Only once that Lyu Ruhui is dead

33:57.660 --> 33:58.660
can everything

33:58.790 --> 34:00.220
finally be settled.

34:01.030 --> 34:01.790
Heng.

34:02.570 --> 34:05.050
Do as I told you before.

34:05.640 --> 34:07.160
Once this is over,

34:07.640 --> 34:09.969
take the money
you've saved over the years

34:10.400 --> 34:12.150
and leave Qianshan.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.860
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

34:14.150 --> 34:14.679
Uncle...

34:15.239 --> 34:16.840
Never come back.

34:18.190 --> 34:18.760
Uncle,

34:19.929 --> 34:20.790
what about you?

34:21.270 --> 34:23.230
I know too much.

34:24.280 --> 34:27.280
I'm afraid I'll have to spend
the rest of my days in the Tianxiang Sect.

34:27.280 --> 34:28.880
But as long as I'm still here,

34:28.960 --> 34:31.330
no one will care where you go.

34:32.730 --> 34:34.520
That's why I can't leave.

34:35.989 --> 34:36.510
Uncle,

34:36.889 --> 34:37.620
how about...

34:42.159 --> 34:44.360
I'll go back to my room and get some rest.

34:57.050 --> 35:00.530
When did you pick up this opium habit?

35:03.300 --> 35:03.760
Uncle,

35:03.880 --> 35:04.320
you...

35:13.060 --> 35:15.420
I told you before,

35:15.960 --> 35:17.670
I won't interfere
with your drinking, eating,

35:17.670 --> 35:19.030
whoring, or gambling.

35:19.180 --> 35:20.300
But you absolutely

35:20.610 --> 35:22.010
cannot touch opium.

35:30.630 --> 35:31.240
Uncle,

35:32.070 --> 35:33.070
I know I was wrong.

35:33.550 --> 35:33.960
I...

35:35.070 --> 35:36.030
I'll quit.

35:37.460 --> 35:38.590
I promise I'll quit.

36:27.090 --> 36:30.770
[Half a month later]

36:57.550 --> 36:58.920
Gentlemen,

36:59.280 --> 37:01.080
you've all inspected the goods.

37:01.240 --> 37:02.320
Satisfied?

37:02.360 --> 37:04.320
Satisfied.

37:04.440 --> 37:05.470
Very satisfied.

37:06.070 --> 37:06.960
Good to hear.

37:07.840 --> 37:08.630
However,

37:09.470 --> 37:11.000
the price for this shipment

37:11.470 --> 37:13.870
will be 30% higher
than originally agreed.

37:14.510 --> 37:15.070
Well...

37:18.190 --> 37:20.510
You all know what things
are like in Qianshan.

37:20.510 --> 37:21.670
We lost quite a few of our men

37:21.670 --> 37:23.270
getting this shipment here.

37:23.360 --> 37:24.760
The extra 30%

37:25.030 --> 37:27.760
will go
toward the burial expenses for those men.

37:27.880 --> 37:28.840
Do we have a deal?

37:31.190 --> 37:31.650
Well...

37:33.720 --> 37:34.450
Adjutant Xu,

37:34.720 --> 37:36.920
that's quite a difference

37:36.920 --> 37:38.110
from the price we agreed on.

37:38.110 --> 37:39.150
I don't have

37:39.240 --> 37:41.510
that much cash on hand right now.

37:41.990 --> 37:44.550
Why don't you offer it to someone else?

37:44.800 --> 37:45.760
I'll pass

37:47.280 --> 37:48.920
on this shipment.

37:49.470 --> 37:50.200
Adjutant Xu,

37:50.230 --> 37:51.410
I'm short on cash too.

37:51.410 --> 37:53.210
I'll have to pass.

37:55.550 --> 37:57.550
I've been too nice to you, haven't I?

38:03.110 --> 38:03.760
Speak up!

38:05.470 --> 38:06.730
Let me make this clear:

38:06.840 --> 38:08.440
you're taking this shipment

38:08.800 --> 38:10.150
whether you want it

38:11.070 --> 38:12.320
or not.

38:13.760 --> 38:15.020
Do I make myself clear?

38:37.190 --> 38:37.880
Commander,

38:38.240 --> 38:39.440
what brings you here?

38:42.840 --> 38:44.740
Commander, you may have misunderstood.

38:44.740 --> 38:46.220
Adjutant Xu and I

38:46.400 --> 38:47.360
were trying to lure them out,

38:47.360 --> 38:48.070
wipe

38:48.630 --> 38:49.440
them all out,

38:49.760 --> 38:50.360
and then

38:50.510 --> 38:51.570
report back to you.

38:54.470 --> 38:55.330
Premium goods.

38:56.280 --> 38:57.720
I was just outside

38:57.760 --> 38:59.620
and I think I heard Adjutant Xu say

39:00.070 --> 39:01.280
that the price for this shipment

39:01.280 --> 39:03.190
is 30% higher than usual.

39:03.470 --> 39:06.270
And it seems you weren't
willing to pay, am I right?

39:08.720 --> 39:10.800
I don't quite understand.

39:12.400 --> 39:14.130
Why weren't you willing to pay?

39:14.990 --> 39:16.150
This shipment was brought here

39:16.150 --> 39:18.110
inside the bodies of my fallen men.

39:18.820 --> 39:21.300
They gave their lives for me.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.920
They didn't even get a proper burial.

39:22.920 --> 39:23.720
Instead,

39:24.240 --> 39:26.550
their riddled corpses

39:26.880 --> 39:27.550
were cut

39:27.590 --> 39:28.320
open,

39:28.410 --> 39:30.920
their insides removed,
every last organ taken out.

39:30.920 --> 39:32.150
If I'm not mistaken,

39:32.150 --> 39:33.030
the cleaner

39:33.280 --> 39:34.920
they were emptied out, the better, right?

39:34.920 --> 39:36.310
Because that's the only way

39:36.310 --> 39:38.090
you can pack in more opium paste,

39:38.090 --> 39:39.300
sew them back up,

39:39.400 --> 39:40.590
and haul them

39:40.670 --> 39:41.320
here

39:41.320 --> 39:42.850
through all that hardship,

39:45.470 --> 39:46.870
so you can make a fortune.

39:47.070 --> 39:49.360
They died clean.

39:49.590 --> 39:51.320
Now their bodies have been defiled.

39:51.320 --> 39:52.320
Under

39:52.470 --> 39:54.110
Under these circumstances,

39:54.400 --> 39:58.110
isn't a 30% price increase only fair?

40:18.360 --> 40:19.880
I heard you're blind.

40:24.920 --> 40:25.920
You're not blind.

40:30.260 --> 40:32.180
You just think I'm the blind one.

40:35.190 --> 40:36.120
Commander Feng,

40:36.920 --> 40:39.110
I've always had great respect
for you soldiers.

40:39.110 --> 40:41.680
I was deceived by Colonel Lei too.

40:41.880 --> 40:44.800
He told me these bodies belonged to miners
who had died in an accident.

40:44.800 --> 40:46.960
I was only running an errand for him,

40:47.400 --> 40:49.400
making a little money for my trouble.

40:49.400 --> 40:50.400
You know full well

40:50.990 --> 40:53.030
how many dirty deeds
you've all been involved in

40:53.030 --> 40:54.570
behind the scenes over the years.

40:54.570 --> 40:55.970
Now that he's dead,

41:06.400 --> 41:07.920
you're next.

41:09.800 --> 41:11.110
I see.

41:12.990 --> 41:13.670
Kid,

41:13.760 --> 41:15.190
if I'd known this would happen,

41:15.190 --> 41:16.850
I should've killed you myself

41:17.400 --> 41:19.550
back at Longxuya.

41:27.380 --> 41:28.220
Du Binghui,

41:28.790 --> 41:29.940
you're not dead yet.

41:31.290 --> 41:32.770
How could I bear to die?

41:48.880 --> 41:50.150
We're corpse drivers,

41:50.150 --> 41:51.440
taking the dead home.

41:51.530 --> 41:53.300
You're dressed

41:53.380 --> 41:55.580
as if you were about to perform in a play.

41:56.150 --> 41:57.150
How fascinating.

41:57.280 --> 41:59.150
The corpse can even move on its own.

41:59.150 --> 42:00.550
How do you do that?

42:01.350 --> 42:02.510
[Blind Du isn't blind]

42:06.880 --> 42:08.400
I'll put you somewhere else

42:08.400 --> 42:10.190
so you can cool off.

42:10.190 --> 42:10.800
Move!

42:15.830 --> 42:17.160
Where are you taking me?

42:20.550 --> 42:21.510
Wait here.

42:27.850 --> 42:49.510
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

42:57.870 --> 42:59.240
This is the new performer.

42:59.240 --> 42:59.990
Her stage name is Feiyan.

42:59.990 --> 43:00.800
What are you doing?

43:00.800 --> 43:01.800
What are you doing?

43:01.800 --> 43:03.920
No one has ever celebrated
my birthday for me.

43:03.920 --> 43:04.590
Thank you.

43:04.670 --> 43:05.270
Mom,

43:05.510 --> 43:06.360
I'll go get a doctor.

43:06.360 --> 43:07.990
You haven't eaten anything all night.

43:07.990 --> 43:08.990
Come and have some porridge.

43:08.990 --> 43:10.240
Since we've tied the knot,

43:10.240 --> 43:11.190
we're husband and wife.

43:11.190 --> 43:12.360
Your business is my business.

43:12.360 --> 43:13.440
How can I stay out of it?

43:13.440 --> 43:14.360
From now on,

43:14.440 --> 43:16.150
every minute and every second

43:16.440 --> 43:17.510
belongs to us.

43:17.840 --> 43:18.800
I once

43:19.150 --> 43:21.190
ran into an old gentleman surnamed Du.

43:21.190 --> 43:22.920
He said I was born to bring ruin,

43:22.920 --> 43:24.630
first to my parents and friends,

43:24.630 --> 43:26.090
then to any devoted lover.

43:26.240 --> 43:27.770
Everyone who treats me well

43:27.840 --> 43:28.590
ends up

43:29.280 --> 43:30.550
dying because of me.

43:34.450 --> 43:36.710
[In the next episode]

43:36.840 --> 43:37.990
Liang,

43:38.110 --> 43:39.470
my name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

43:39.840 --> 43:41.640
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

43:42.180 --> 43:44.380
The road I'm about to take is dangerous.

43:44.540 --> 43:45.690
We should go our separate ways.

43:45.690 --> 43:47.820
If you're in danger, all the more reason
I should come with you.

43:47.820 --> 43:49.880
What if I have to kill the Sect Master?

43:50.570 --> 43:51.780
Take my advice.

43:51.990 --> 43:53.450
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

43:53.930 --> 43:55.140
None of them

43:56.060 --> 43:57.270
will die a peaceful death.
